+</div><div class="memdoc">
+<p>This describes the gamma ramp for a monitor.</p>
+<dl class="section see"><dt>See also</dt><dd><a class="el" href="monitor_guide.html#monitor_gamma">Gamma ramp</a> </dd>
+<dd>
