+ *  On machines that support `GL_KHR_context_flush_control`, you can control
+ *  whether a context performs this flush by setting the
+ *  [GLFW_CONTEXT_RELEASE_BEHAVIOR](@ref GLFW_CONTEXT_RELEASE_BEHAVIOR_hint)
+ *  hint.
