+ *  see `vkQueuePresentKHR` instead.
+ *
+ *  @param[in] window The window whose buffers to swap.
+ *
+ *  @errors Possible errors include @ref GLFW_NOT_INITIALIZED, @ref
+ *  GLFW_NO_WINDOW_CONTEXT and @ref GLFW_PLATFORM_ERROR.
+ *
