-        </tr>
-      </table>
-</div><div class="memdoc">
-<p>If this bit is set the Num Lock key is enabled and the <a class="el" href="input_guide.html#GLFW_LOCK_KEY_MODS">GLFW_LOCK_KEY_MODS</a> input mode is set. </p>
