-<dd>
-<a class="el" href="group__window.html#ga371911f12c74c504dd8d47d832d095cb">glfwSetWindowSize</a></dd></dl>
-<dl class="section since"><dt>Since</dt><dd>Added in version 3.2. </dd></dl>
