- *
- *  @param[in] window The window to query.
- *  @param[in] mode One of `GLFW_CURSOR`, `GLFW_STICKY_KEYS`,
- *  `GLFW_STICKY_MOUSE_BUTTONS`, `GLFW_LOCK_KEY_MODS` or
- *  `GLFW_RAW_MOUSE_MOTION`.
